&nbsp;鐵窗.紗窗&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;防護&nbsp;+&nbsp;隱私防範設備&nbsp;+&nbsp;逃生門.....<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;陽光充足.&nbsp;光線好.空氣佳.&nbsp;不必爬樓<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;梯,&nbsp;也不必坐電梯.<br><br>2.&nbsp;恆溫25-26度，夏天涼快,&nbsp;冬天溫暖..<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.....很省電。<br><br>3.&nbsp;全新裝潢,&nbsp;提供120m網路.&nbsp;第四台.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;冷熱飲水機，獨用全自動洗衣機，<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大雙人床，&nbsp;全新大螢幕液晶電視.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;整套全新凱薩衛浴設備，&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;全新多功能書桌+書架：一體胡桃木<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;桌子，高級扶手電腦椅。紗發。<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;全新瞬間電熱水器,&nbsp;冷氣,.....<br>.<br>4.&nbsp;寵物：有限制。有意者再詳談。<br>.</p>\r\n附近有便利商店、公園綠地。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "南港區研究院路二段213巷", "lat": "25.0360509", "lng": "121.6172122", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "凌雲五村站", "distance": 30, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約30公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "九如里二站", "distance": 161, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約161公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "九如里一站", "distance": 189, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約189公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "restaurant", "name": "晨光複合式早餐", "distance": 39, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約39公尺"}, {"type": "shop", "name": "葦伶花店", "distance": 816, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約816公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "臺北市南港區舊莊國民小學", "distance": 466, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約466公尺"}, {"type": "university", "name": "中華科技大學", "distance": 784, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約784公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "10,800元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月租金", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "電費", "value": "獨立電表", "key": "electricFee"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "管理費、水費、網路、第四台、清潔費", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使照", "key": "